{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1102","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Monotonic Renumeration"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$a$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ integers. Let's denote "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"monotonic renumeration"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of array $$$a$$$ as an array $$$b$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ integers such that all of the following conditions are met:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b_1 = 0$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for every pair of indices $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$ such that $$$1 \\le i, j \\le n$$$, if $$$a_i = a_j$$$, then $$$b_i = b_j$$$ (note that if $$$a_i \\ne a_j$$$, it is still possible that $$$b_i = b_j$$$); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for every index $$$i \\in [1, n - 1]$$$ either $$$b_i = b_{i + 1}$$$ or $$$b_i + 1 = b_{i + 1}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, if $$$a = [1, 2, 1, 2, 3]$$$, then two possible monotonic renumerations of $$$a$$$ are $$$b = [0, 0, 0, 0, 0]$$$ and $$$b = [0, 0, 0, 0, 1]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to calculate the number of different monotonic renumerations of $$$a$$$. The answer may be large, so print it modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of elements in $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the number of different monotonic renumerations of $$$a$$$, taken modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n1 2 1 2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n100 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n1 3 3 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1102E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1102/problem/E"}